  "goodToKnow": "Schmuggeln means to smuggle: Drogen, Zigaretten, Menschen schmuggeln, and humorously a Spickzettel (crib sheet) into an exam. Der Schmuggel is smuggling and der Schmuggler a smuggler; human smugglers are Schleuser. Historically, coffee smuggling over the Aachen-Belgian border after WWII was so common the route was called the Kaffeefront. Regular: schmuggelte, geschmuggelt."
